# The samples of the AI-reading measurement: the author's handwriting, with the time and pressure
# of every stroke. They stay out of git; agents may open them since 2026-10-27, but nothing of them
# comes into the repository: CLAUDE.md and docs/architecture.md, section 3.1 (R05, R32).
/samples/

# What code draws — sheets, their pictures and splits — and the runs on them: no handwriting. They
# stay out of git too, and agents work with them: CLAUDE.md and docs/architecture.md, section 3.4
# (R28).
/synthetic/

# What release-files writes, for .github's shared release to sign and publish (R62).
/dist/

# The coverage of the tests that ci-test writes, which CI sends to Codecov (R66).
/coverage/
